[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0010","text":"！　制作人大人……！\n您辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0020","text":"啊，辛苦了\n——对了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0030","text":"之前让你试穿的那套衣装，\n成品已经送到仓库了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0040","text":"――――……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0050","text":"哦，真不错！\n很合身啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0060","text":"————……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0070","text":"啊，喂……凛世……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0080","text":"（凛世，怎么了……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0090","text":"………………\n……呼………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11200200_01_0100","text":"——！\n凛世……！？"}]
